  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/06/IMG_8940.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(8 fotos) El Local de Asociaciones de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este jueves un acto, promovido por la ONG Quisqueya, en el que la Plataforma por la igualdad de derechos de las personas trabajadoras del hogar ha reclamado, entre otras cuestiones, una contrataci&oacute;n responsable.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritastreballadoresdomestiques/img_8935.jpg\" alt=\"img_8935\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritastreballadoresdomestiques/img_8940.jpg\" alt=\"img_8940\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritastreballadoresdomestiques/img_8942.jpg\" alt=\"img_8942\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritastreballadoresdomestiques/img_8945.jpg\" alt=\"img_8945\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritastreballadoresdomestiques/img_8947.jpg\" alt=\"img_8947\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritastreballadoresdomestiques/img_8948.jpg\" alt=\"img_8948\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritastreballadoresdomestiques/img_8949.jpg\" alt=\"img_8949\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradacaritastreballadoresdomestiques/img_8951.jpg\" alt=\"img_8951\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
